/*
  NotificationBellPopover.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0010 · NotificationBellPopover (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `NotificationBellPopover` resolves (table "NotificationBellPopover") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (components/layout/NotificationBellPopover.tsx). The second group is the severity-label
  catalog the web `SEVERITY_TONE` map carries (used as the dot's VoiceOver label). The third +
  fourth groups back the native chrome (relative-time buckets, P4 freshness / retry / banner
  copy) so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

